# Thread

::summary
The conversation thread surface in the shell wrapper: circled back (narrow), presence + name + membership subtitle header with Participants, bubbles, the chat-input-simple composer with attach, and compose mode. The attach menu is `modals/attach-menu.surf` (anchored dropdown-select); the doc/task picker, media picker, reaction palette, and participants sheets live in `modals/` — no inline copies.
::

